e them accountable ugh\n\n10\n\nBonnie Stephens\n\nWhile they let criminals out for fear of covid-19\n\n6\n\nWalter Powelson\n\nWhat about all the protesters, isn't that considered a large party . What's fair for one is fair for everybody. Too much nitpicking.\n\n5\n\nView 1 reply\n\nBill Kary\n\nHere’s something worth rioting about..... This is complete and total insanity.\n\n5","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2169.9292790001437,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}